%% Product Requisition State Diagram
%% Shows Product Requisition state transitions

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft: PR Created
    
    Draft --> PendingDistribution: Submit for<br/>Distribution Approval<br/>(ProductRequisitionSubmitted)
    Draft --> [*]: Delete PR
    
    PendingDistribution --> PendingProcurement: Distribution<br/>Approved
    PendingDistribution --> Rejected: Distribution<br/>Rejected<br/>(ProductRequisitionRejected)
    PendingDistribution --> Draft: Return to Draft
    
    PendingProcurement --> Approved: Procurement<br/>Approved<br/>(ProductRequisitionApproved)
    PendingProcurement --> Rejected: Procurement<br/>Rejected<br/>(ProductRequisitionRejected)
    PendingProcurement --> PendingStock: Stock Check<br/>Required
    PendingProcurement --> Draft: Return to Draft
    
    PendingStock --> Approved: Stock Available
    PendingStock --> Rejected: Insufficient Stock
    PendingStock --> PendingProcurement: Return for Review
    
    Approved --> [*]: TR Created<br/>(TransportRequestCreated)
    
    Rejected --> [*]: Rejection Recorded
    
    note right of Draft
        Initial state
        Can be edited
        Not yet submitted
    end note
    
    note right of PendingDistribution
        Waiting for Distribution
        team approval
        First approval step
    end note
    
    note right of PendingProcurement
        Waiting for Procurement
        team approval
        Second approval step
    end note
    
    note right of PendingStock
        Stock availability
        check required
        May need to wait
    end note
    
    note right of Approved
        PR approved
        Triggers TR creation
        Cannot be modified
    end note
    
    note right of Rejected
        PR rejected
        Reason recorded
        Cannot be modified
    end note

